{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDE2L1NvbnMlMjBPZiUyMEJlbiUyMCUyODIwMTYlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Sons Of Ben","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/5ffucnsGQiJljgd0qKPGWcvX7m1.jpg","description":"After many rumors of an MLS team arriving in Philadelphia never materializing, a small group of soccer fans took matters into their own hands and started a supporters group called the Sons of Ben to help bring a team to their hometown. They were a group without a team to root for and had a modest goal of reaching 100 members by the end of the year. Little did they know they would reach over 1,500 members in less time than that and start a movement that would not only change the soccer landscape in Philadelphia forever, but also help revive a community that had been struggling for decades.\n\nReleased 13 Jun 2015 · US · Language: English\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2016","genres":["Documentary","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.6","director":["Jeffrey C. Bell"],"released":"2015-06-13T00:00:00.000Z","country":"US","language":"English","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Jeffrey C. Bell","character":"Director"}]},"links":[{"name":"Jeffrey C. Bell","category":"Director","url":"stremio:///search?search=Jeffrey%20C.%20Bell"},{"name":"Documentary","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///search?search=Documentary"},{"name":"To Kill A Tiger","category":"More like this","url":"stremio:///detail/movie/dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDIyL1RvJTIwS2lsbCUyMEElMjBUaWdlciUyMCUyODIwMjIlMjkv"},{"name":"Orgasm Inc The Story Of OneTaste","category":"More like this","url":"stremio:///detail/movie/dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDIyL09yZ2FzbSUyMEluYyUyMFRoZSUyMFN0b3J5JTIwT2YlMjBPbmVUYXN0ZSUyMCUyODIwMjIlMjkv"},{"name":"MoviePass MovieCrash","category":"More like this","url":"stremio:///detail/movie/dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d2